{"availability":"available","full":"pravindev666/JUDAH-Nifty-Oracle","name":"JUDAH-Nifty-Oracle","description":"An advanced ML trading dashboard for Nifty 50. JUDAH uses an automated XGBoost pipeline that grid-searches 360 combinations daily across 6 horizons. The live Streamlit engine fuses a 4-pillar probability ensemble to generate mathematically precise, high-conviction options strategies (Spreads/Strangles) and Strike recommendations.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":5,"forks":2,"created":"2026-03-30T00:44:27Z","updated":"2026-08-09T04:48:08Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://elohei-judah.streamlit.app/","topics":["algorithmic-trading","ensemble-learning","github-actions","grid-search","hyperparameter-tuning","machine-learning","market-regimes","nifty50","options-trading","predictive-analytics","python","quantitative-finance","stock-market","streamlit","trading-bot","xgboost-model"],"demo":"https://elohei-judah.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.262Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.262Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.262Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:33:55.808Z","stars":5,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:25:39.510Z","stars":5,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-11T11:03:53.390Z","stars":5,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-17T12:28:08.094Z","stars":5,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.262Z","stars":5,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One dashboard. One decision. Every morning. Should I trade? Which direction? What strategy? At what strikes?","JUDAH is a production-grade, AI-powered Nifty 50 trading decision engine built in Python. It ingests 26+ market data sources (including 13 global macro assets), engineers 143+ features, and combines a 5-pillar decision engine (Regime Scoring, Empirical Probability, Monte Carlo Simulation, Bayesian Signal Analysis, and XGBoost AI) to produce one high-precision trade recommendation every market day.","The winning parameters must perform well across all three regimes. This prevents \"lucky\" parameters that only worked in one specific market condition."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravindev666/JUDAH-Nifty-Oracle/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fa7bc7e30524bfcde560e6240435bbbcb9cce8887481916cb6ae2d03c5b3291d","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:56.270Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.358Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"One dashboard. One decision. Every morning. Should I trade? Which direction? What strategy? At what strikes?","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravindev666/JUDAH-Nifty-Oracle/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"fa7bc7e30524bfcde560e6240435bbbcb9cce8887481916cb6ae2d03c5b3291d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravindev666/JUDAH-Nifty-Oracle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.358Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-09T04:48:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravindev666/JUDAH-Nifty-Oracle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.359Z","hash":"fa7bc7e30524bfcde560e6240435bbbcb9cce8887481916cb6ae2d03c5b3291d","originalBytes":28878,"storedBytes":28878,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T00:48:29.262Z","subjects":["Maths & algorithms","Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Finance","subjects":["Maths & algorithms","Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Maths & algorithms","source":"metadata","match":"probability"},{"subject":"Data & dashboards","source":"metadata","match":"dashboard"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Simulation & physics","Automation & workflows"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://elohei-judah.streamlit.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-14T08:46:56.995Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-